# Telegram List Authority — 파일락

감사 SSOT: `docs/community-messenger/telegram-list-authority-writer-audit.md`  
검증: `npm run verify:telegram-list-authority`

## 계약

방→리스트 remount (hydrated):

- memory paint only
- **금지:** `refresh(true)` silent · Gate TTL remount fetch · prefetch always-revalidate · CM dual-write · hub raw `patchBootstrapRoomList*` / `chats.map` bypass · full replace

Surface reducer 1개:

- hub GD+group → `applyHomeListPatch` only (session mirror 포함)
- trade / store_order → Domain canary + `domain-list-canary-realtime-patch` only

## DO NOT

- `dual-write-domain-list-from-rooms` 파일·import 부활 (ESLint + verify FAIL)
- QUARANTINED no-op 파일로 대체
- remount 치유용 신규 cold/tip/dwell lock
- MARK_READ/PARTICIPANT_UNREAD로 preview/LMA 쓰기
- 서버 PATCH 실패 시 전체 list refetch
- hydrated 리스트에 silent `refresh(true)` (home_sync tip rewrite)
- `cm.home.social_sync` → `refresh(true)` (friends 는 `hydrateMessengerFriends`)
- product hub paint 에 canonical/dual overlay (`source: "legacy"` 고정)
- Host `noteBootstrapCacheBusWriterViewerUserId(null)` → `clearBootstrapCache`
